# Spark IDE - proven quoted ide ask bind (-> reply) + print.
# After new-bind. Bare ask bind is ide_ask_bind; this proves
# ask "instruction" -> reply stores Gravity text too.
# Run: ./spark --dry-run examples/ide_ask_quote_bind.spark
# No Electron. No new asm - documents proven bind only.

ide open "examples/hello.spark"

ide ask "Explain gravity in one sentence" -> reply

print reply
